        "original_id": "f62d081d-9cdb-5ae0-9df3-d81e11a94a71",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Land Rover Defender, Land Rover Ninety, Land Rover One Ten, Land Rover Series\n- Companies: Jaguar Land Rover Automotive PLC, Jaguar Land Rover Limited, Tata Motors\n- Places: Whitley, Coventry, United Kingdom\n- Topics: off-road vehicles, four-wheel drive\n\nFacts:\n- The original Land Rover Series was launched in June 1948.\n- The Land Rover Defender was developed from the original Land Rover Series.\n- The Land Rover Defender was initially called the Land Rover Ninety and Land Rover One Ten.\n- The Land Rover Defender is a British four-wheel drive off-road vehicle.\n- Jaguar Land Rover announced its intention to launch a completely new Defender.\n- Jaguar Land Rover Automotive PLC is the holding company of Jaguar Land Rover Limited.\n- Jaguar Land Rover Limited is a British multinational automotive company headquartered in Whitley, Coventry, United Kingdom.\n- Jaguar Land Rover Automotive PLC is a subsidiary of Tata Motors.",
